  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &quot;Towards Burma 2010 elections: Strengthening                Citizen-Focussed Approach to Democracy Building through Democratic    Voice of Burma (DVB)&quot; har som f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntat resultat att DVB skall ha     kapacitet att effektivt f&#xf6;rmedla information om den politiska process som kulminerar i allm&#xe4;nna val i Burma 2010.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &quot;Towards Burma 2010 elections: Strengthening              Citizen-Focussed Approach to Democracy Building through Democratic    Voice of Burma (DVB)&quot; is expected to provide DVB with capacity to     effectively cover the political process leading up to the general     election in Burma 2010.</narrative>
  </description>
